@node Timetable
@chapter Timetable
@cindex timetable
@cindex RUZ
@cindex ruz.spbstu.ru

The Timetable screen shows this week's classes of one study group at
Peter the Great St.@: Petersburg Polytechnic University, from the
university's timetable service RUZ (@uref{https://ruz.spbstu.ru}).

There is one column per day from Monday to Saturday, and one for Sunday
when it has classes.  Each class shows its time, subject, kind (lecture,
practice, lab), room and teacher.  Today's column is highlighted; past
classes are dimmed, the class in progress is marked @samp{●} and the
next one today @samp{▸}.  The heading gives the group, the week's dates
and whether the week is odd or even.

@section Data source

raspdash uses RUZ's JSON interface, the one behind its web pages:

@table @code
@item GET /api/v1/ruz/search/groups?q=@var{name}
finds the numeric id of the group named exactly @var{name}.
@item GET /api/v1/ruz/scheduler/@var{id}?date=@var{yyyy-mm-dd}
returns the Monday-to-Sunday week containing that date.
@end table

The interface is not documented and may change.  The week is fetched
every three days, and as soon as a new week starts (by the date in the
@code{timezone} below); the cached copy survives restarts
(@pxref{Sources and caching}).

@cindex retake groups
A search can return several groups with similar names.  For example,
@samp{5151003/50001_2025} next to @samp{5151003/50001} holds only
retake sessions (@samp{Комиссия. Зачёт}).  raspdash takes the exact
name match only.

@section Settings
@cindex @code{[timetable]}

@table @code
@item group
The group's name exactly as RUZ spells it, such as
@samp{"5151003/50001"}.  Required unless @code{group_id} is given.
@item group_id
The group's numeric RUZ id.  When given, raspdash skips the name
search.  The id is in the address of the group's page on
@uref{https://ruz.spbstu.ru}, for example @samp{/faculty/125/groups/45516}.
@item interval
Seconds between fetches.  Default: 259200 (three days).
@item timezone
The time zone the timetable is in, which decides what @dfn{today} and
@dfn{this week} are.  Default: @samp{"Europe/Moscow"}.
@item show_teachers
Whether to show each class's teacher.  Default: true.
@item api
The base address of the interface.  Default:
@samp{"https://ruz.spbstu.ru/api/v1/ruz"}.
@end table

@example
[timetable]
group = "5151003/50001"
interval = 259200
@end example
